        "# Argument\n",
        "\n",
        "An argument is a value supplied to a callable when it is called. Arguments may be positional or keyword arguments; parameters are the names in the callable's definition.\n",
        "\n",
        "Source: [Python glossary](https://docs.python.org/3/glossary.html#term-argument)"
      ]
    }
